f1=A.a([A.w(h8,"Every table is different! The same strategy won't work everywhere. You need to adapt to your specific opponents.",h9,h9),A.w(h8,"Tight table (everyone plays safe): You can be more aggressive! Opponents won't challenge you, so build bigger hands freely.",h9,h9),A.w(h8,"Loose table (everyone plays aggressively): Play tighter! Let them deal into each other while you wait for safe opportunities.",h9,h9),A.w(h8,"Mixed table: Identify the weakest player and position yourself to win from their discards. Avoid confronting the strongest player directly.",h9,h9)],n5)
