e7=A.a([A.w(h8,"A mahjong session is 16+ hands. Winning the session means consistent good decisions, not just one lucky hand!",h9,h9),A.w(h8,"Avoid tilt! After a bad loss, don't chase losses with risky play. Take a breath, reset, and play your normal game.",h9,h9),A.w(h8,"Bankroll awareness: Track your running total. Adjust aggression based on whether you're up or down for the session.",h9,h9),A.w(h8,"Endurance: Stay focused in late rounds! Many players get sloppy after 10+ hands. Consistent focus is your edge.",h9,h9)],n5)
