h5=A.a([A.w(h8,"Your outs are only half the story. The other half is what the other three players have already shown you.",h9,h9),A.w(h8,"An exposed pung names a suit. A kong takes four copies out of the game. A player who throws nothing but pin for three rounds is telling you pin is not what he needs.",h9,h9),A.w(m9,"So the same hand can want a different tile at a different table?",h9,h9),A.w(h8,"Same fourteen tiles, different table, different right answer. That is the whole lesson.",h9,h9),A.w(h8,"And when a big hand is sitting opposite you, fewer outs on a tile that has already passed him is the better trade.",h9,h9)],n5)
